.snapshots/

# Non-prod generated output. These builds are NOT privacy-redacted --
# _resolve_privacy_redaction only redacts in prod -- so a dev/eval index.html
# carries private planning links and lodging/booking details verbatim.
#
# This repo is public and its Pages workflow uploads path: '.', the whole
# repository, so anything staged here is published. run-trip.BAT's publish
# step runs `git add -A` on any run that passes validation, with no
# environment check, which would sweep these in. Ignoring them means that
# can't happen regardless of what any script does.
sw/dev/
sw/eval/
dev/
eval/
